# Recorded cutscene takes. A take is scratch for judging a cut — a few hundred
# frames per recording, several recordings per session — and committing them
# would put a megabyte of near-identical stills in the history for every shot
# anyone tried. A take worth keeping gets copied into the review queue by hand.
